---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import LiveCluster from '../components/LiveCluster';
import ClusterSketch from '../components/ClusterSketch.astro';
import {getLessons,lessonHref} from '../lib/content';
import {modules} from '../data/modules';
const lessons=await getLessons();
const first=lessons[0];
---
<Base><div class="page-pad home-page">
 <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
   <h1 id="home-title">Kubernetes, <span>in motion.</span></h1>
   <p>Follow a request through the cluster, watch a workload recover, and try the same experiments in a local lab.</p>
   <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="button primary" href={first?lessonHref(first):'/curriculum/'}>Start learning <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    <a class="text-link" href="/curriculum/">Browse the lessons</a>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual"><LiveCluster client:visible /></div>
 </section>
 <div class="course-facts"><span><strong>{modules.length}</strong>modules</span><span><strong>{lessons.length}</strong>visual lessons</span><span><strong>3</strong>learning levels</span></div>
 <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="path-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="path-title">A path through the system.</h2><a class="text-link" href="/curriculum/">View every lesson →</a></div><div class="learning-path"><a class="path-row" href="/curriculum/#foundations"><h3>Foundations</h3><p>Understand the objects, components, and control loops. Deploy an application and follow its traffic.</p><span><ClusterSketch variant="foundations"/><span class="path-count">6 modules · 18 lessons ↗</span></span></a><a class="path-row" href="/curriculum/#intermediate"><h3>Intermediate</h3><p>Make workloads reliable. Reason about placement, networking, storage, security, and delivery.</p><span><ClusterSketch variant="intermediate"/><span class="path-count">7 modules · 21 lessons ↗</span></span></a><a class="path-row" href="/curriculum/#advanced"><h3>Advanced</h3><p>Open the control plane. Build operators, investigate pressure, and design recovery and platform boundaries.</p><span><ClusterSketch variant="advanced"/><span class="path-count">7 modules · 21 lessons ↗</span></span></a></div></section>
 <section class="home-closing"><div><h2>Watch it work.<br/>Understand it by doing.</h2></div><div><p>Every lesson connects a mechanism to a visual model, a failure case, and a local exercise. Start with the explanation, change an input, predict the outcome, then test your understanding in a real cluster.</p><a class="text-link" href="/labs/">Open the laboratories →</a></div></section>
 </div></Base>
